## Section

More content. You can use standard Markdown — links, code blocks, images, etc.

```ts
// Code blocks work as expected
const x = 42;
```

This file is only a reference for supported MDX syntax. Published posts are
generated from Google Docs/Sheets at build time and are ignored by git.

When ready to publish:
1. Write the post in Google Docs
2. Add a row to the blog Google Sheet
3. Put the Google Doc ID or URL in google_doc_id
4. Set published to true
5. Run: GOOGLE_BLOG_SHEET_ID=<sheet-id> npm run build-blog
